1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,600
(Penny:)Why are you making this
so difficult?

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,830
(Leonard:)It's not difficult for me.

3
00:00:03,830 --> 00:00:05,530
(Leonard:)I'm having fun.

4
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:06,730
(Man:)Leonard.

5
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:08,370
(Leonard:)What do you want me to do?
You started this.

6
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:10,370
(Leonard:)Do you want to go over
and tell him we're broken up?

7
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:11,440
(Raj:)No.
Well, then, what do you want?

8
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:12,640
(Wyatt:)I don't know.

9
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:14,040
(Leonard:)Don't you think that's something
you should

10
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,640
(Leonard:)have figured out
before you stomped over here?

11
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:18,040
(Howard:)Maybe.

12
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:20,710
(Sheldon:)Leonard, Penny, excellent.

13
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:23,220
(Sheldon:)I'd like to say I'm very happy
that you're back together,

14
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:25,750
(Sheldon:)and if I can figure out
a way to do so

15
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:28,190
(Sheldon:)and sound sincere, I will.

16
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,590
(Sheldon:)In the meantime,

17
00:00:29,590 --> 00:00:31,660
(Sheldon:)I'd like to go over
some proposed changes

18
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:33,930
(Sheldon:)to the roommate agreement
specifically to address

19
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:35,610
(Sheldon:)Penny's annoying
personal habits.

20
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:37,530
(Penny:)Oh, my God.

21
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:39,950
(Penny:)What personal habits?
I have a list.

22
00:00:39,950 --> 00:00:44,270
(Leonard:)FYI, overuse of the phrase
"Oh, my God" is number 12.

23
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:47,110
(Penny:)Okay, Sheldon,
you don't have to do this

24
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:48,490
(Penny:)because Leonard and I are not...
Ba-ba-ba-ba.

25
00:00:48,490 --> 00:00:50,610
(Leonard:)Are you sure you want
to include him in this?

26
00:00:50,610 --> 00:00:52,150
(Sheldon:)Include me in what?

27
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:53,710
(Sheldon:)Is there a plot afoot?

28
00:00:53,710 --> 00:00:56,120
(Sheldon:)I'll have no
truck with plots.

29
00:00:56,120 --> 00:00:57,550
(Penny:)No, you're right.

30
00:00:57,550 --> 00:01:01,020
(Penny:)No, there's... there's no plots,
no trucks, no feet.

